# OpenTelemetry configuration for the blackboard runners (runner.py / runner_github.py).
# The endpoint is NOT hardcoded in code; set it here (or export it in the environment).
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is the collector BASE url; the OTLP/HTTP exporter
# appends /v1/traces itself. Use OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TRACES_ENDPOINT for a full URL.
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:6006
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=blackboard
# Tip: OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLO_ENDPOINT (common typo) is also accepted by telemetry.py.
